      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A rare case of synovial chondromatosis of the knee occurring in a 65-year-old man is reported. Electron microscopy of the lesion suggests that the cartilaginous nodules develop through a process of metaplasia from the stromal fibroblasts."},
